{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "delight-account-service-complete",
		"name": "Delight Account Service - Complete",
		"description": "Complete API collection for Delight Account Service (SaaS).\n\n**Authentication Flow:**\n1. Signup at localhost:8080 (no domain required)\n2. Extract domain from signup response\n3. Use domain for all subsequent API calls\n4. Activate user account\n5. Sign in to get JWT token and session cookie\n6. Use JWT token (Bearer) or session cookie for authenticated requests\n\n**Channel Authentication:**\n- Channel endpoints (under /channel/**) require Channel JWT tokens\n- Channel tokens are different from user JWT tokens\n- Generate channel tokens using: `python3 create_channel_jwt.py [account_id] [user_id] [key_version]`\n- Channel endpoints include: /channel/allAccounts, /channel/validateSession, /channel/accounts/info, /channel/accounts/session/validate\n- **Flexible Context Resolution:**\n  • Account context: from JWT `account_id` OR domain lookup from Host header\n  • User context: from JWT `user_id` OR extracted from request body JWT token (POST only)\n\n**Role System:**\n- The system now uses role IDs instead of role enums\n- Default roles: 1=Org Admin, 2=Account Admin, 3=Agent\n- Custom roles can be created based on default roles\n- Use roleId in API requests (e.g., Update Member endpoint)\n\n**Environment Variables:**\n- `base_url`: http://localhost:8080 (for signup and channel APIs)\n- `domain`: Extracted from signup response (used for all other APIs)\n- `jwt_token`: JWT token from signin response\n- `session_id`: Session ID from signin response\n- `channel_token`: Channel JWT token for channel endpoints",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
	"item": [
		{
			"name": "Authentication",
			"item": [
				{
					"name": "1. Signup",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200 || pm.response.code === 201) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (jsonData.domain) {",
									"        pm.environment.set('domain', jsonData.domain);",
									"        pm.environment.set('company_domain', jsonData.domain);",
									"        console.log('Domain set to: ' + jsonData.domain);",
									"    }",
									"    pm.test('Signup successful', function () {",
									"        pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"        pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('domain');",
									"    });",
									"}"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"companyName\": \"Test Company {{$timestamp}}\",\n    \"emailAddress\": \"admin@testcompany.com\",\n    \"industryType\": \"Technology\",\n    \"firstName\": \"Admin\",\n    \"lastName\": \"User\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "{{base_url}}/accounts/signup",
							"host": [
								"{{base_url}}"
							],
							"path": [
								"accounts",
								"signup"
							]
						},
						"description": "Creates a new organization, HRMS account, initial user, and OWNER membership.\n\n**Note:** This endpoint uses `localhost:8080` (no domain required).\n\nThe response contains the `domain` which will be used for all subsequent API calls."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "2. Activate User",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"pm.test('Activation successful', function () {",
									"    pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 201]);",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Host",
								"value": "{{domain}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"emailAddress\": \"admin@testcompany.com\",\n    \"firstName\": \"Admin\",\n    \"lastName\": \"User\",\n    \"phoneNumber\": \"+1-555-123-4567\",\n    \"password\": \"Tr!dent9Alpha\",\n    \"retypePassword\": \"Tr!dent9Alpha\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "http://{{domain}}:8080/accounts/activate",
							"protocol": "http",
							"host": [
								"{{domain}}"
							],
							"port": "8080",
							"path": [
								"accounts",
								"activate"
							]
						},
						"description": "Activates the user account by setting password and completing registration.\n\n**Note:** This endpoint uses the domain from signup response. The Host header must match the domain."
					},
					"response": []
				},
				{
					"name": "3. Sign In",
					"event": [
						{
							"listen": "test",
							"script": {
								"exec": [
									"if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    if (jsonData.jwtToken) {",
									"        pm.environment.set('jwt_token', jsonData.jwtToken);",
									"        console.log('JWT token saved');",
									"    }",
									"    if (jsonData.sessionId) {",
									"        pm.environment.set('session_id', jsonData.sessionId);",
									"        console.log('Session ID saved: ' + jsonData.sessionId);",
									"    }",
									"    ",
									"    // Extract JWT from cookie if available",
									"    var cookies = pm.cookies.all();",
									"    cookies.forEach(function(cookie) {",
									"        if (cookie.name === 'hrsession') {",
									"            pm.environment.set('jwt_token', cookie.value);",
									"            console.log('JWT token extracted from cookie');",
									"        }",
									"    });",
									"}",
									"",
									"pm.test('Signin successful', function () {",
									"    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
									"    var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('jwtToken');",
									"    pm.expect(jsonData).to.have.property('sessionId');",
									"});"
								],
								"type": "text/javascript"
							}
						}
					],
					"request": {
						"method": "POST",
						"header": [
							{
								"key": "Content-Type",
								"value": "application/json"
							},
							{
								"key": "Host",
								"value": "{{domain}}",
								"type": "text"
							}
						],
						"body": {
							"mode": "raw",
							"raw": "{\n    \"emailAddress\": \"admin@testcompany.com\",\n    \"password\": \"Tr!dent9Alpha\"\n}"
						},
						"url": {
							"raw": "http://{{domain}}:8080/accounts/signin",
							"protocol": "http",
							"host": [
								"{{domain}}"
							],
							"port": "8080",
							"path": [
								"accounts",
								"signin"
							]
						},
						"description": "Signs in the user and returns JWT token and session ID.\n\n**Response:**\n- `jwtToken`: JWT token for Bearer authentication\n- `sessionId`: Session identifier\n- Sets `hrsession` cookie for cookie-based authentication\n\n**Note:** The JWT token is automatically saved to environment variable `jwt_token` and can be used for subsequent authenticated requests."
					},
					"response": []
				}
			],
			"description": "Authentication endpoints for signup, activation, and signin"
		},
